1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:01,715
Export your browser history

2
00:00:01,740 --> 00:00:04,555
as CSV, JSON, or HTML.

3
00:00:04,580 --> 00:00:06,435
With HistoryOut, turn your visits

4
00:00:06,460 --> 00:00:07,655
